{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05379","headline":"晚渡伊水 · 韦述","name":"晚渡伊水","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"悠悠涉伊水，伊水清见石。\n是时春向深，两岸草如积。\n迢遰望洲屿，逶迤亘津陌。\n新树落疎红，遥原上深碧。\n回瞻洛阳苑，遽有长山隔。\n烟雾犹辨家，风尘已爲客。\n登陟多异趣，往来见行役。\n云起早已昏，鸟飞日将夕。\n光阴逝不借，超然慕畴昔。\n远游亦何爲？归来存竹帛。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦述","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05379.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05379","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}